</p>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:0 0 24px;">
  <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;color:#004EDE;background:#F5F7FB;border:1px dashed #004EDE;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 28px;">{{code}}</span>
